            "sid": "HEB 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaka cikere me agege ca rik daŋ obedo kede cikkogo me woro Obaŋa, dok daŋ obedo kede kabedo acilloro me lobo man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.26.1+EXO.26.2+EXO.26.3+EXO.26.4+EXO.26.5+EXO.26.6+EXO.26.7+EXO.26.8+EXO.26.9+EXO.26.10+EXO.26.11+EXO.26.12+EXO.26.13+EXO.26.14+EXO.26.15+EXO.26.16+EXO.26.17+EXO.26.18+EXO.26.19+EXO.26.20+EXO.26.21+EXO.26.22+EXO.26.23+EXO.26.24+EXO.26.25+EXO.26.26+EXO.26.27+EXO.26.28+EXO.26.29+EXO.26.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yaa 26.1-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.23+EXO.25.24+EXO.25.25+EXO.25.26+EXO.25.27+EXO.25.28+EXO.25.29+EXO.25.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25.23-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.31+EXO.25.32+EXO.25.33+EXO.25.34+EXO.25.35+EXO.25.36+EXO.25.37+EXO.25.38+EXO.25.39+EXO.25.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "31-40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien rik tye kema ame oyiko, en me oko ame olwoŋo ni Kabedo Acil, ame tye iye gi-cibo tara kede meja, kede ogati ame oketo i nyim Obaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.26.31+EXO.26.32+EXO.26.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yaa 26.31-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I yo ŋe boŋo icika me aryo rik tye iye kema ame olwoŋo ni Kabedo Acil Meicel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.1+EXO.30.2+EXO.30.3+EXO.30.4+EXO.30.5+EXO.30.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yaa 30.1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.10+EXO.25.11+EXO.25.12+EXO.25.13+EXO.25.14+EXO.25.15+EXO.25.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25.10-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.16.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.17.8+NUM.17.9+NUM.17.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 17.8-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yaa 25.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.3+DEU.10.4+DEU.10.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lodo 10.3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuno tye iye keno me waŋo odok akur ame otio kede jabu, kede canduk me cikere ame omwono kome luŋ kede jabu. Iyi canduk me cikere rik tye iye tabo alibi me jabu kede manna i yie, kede abiro Aron a rik lot ca, kede kiddi apada a nwaŋ ocoo iye kop me cikere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.18+EXO.25.19+EXO.25.20+EXO.25.21+EXO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yaa 25.18-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I wi canduk yam tye iye okerubi me kwogo, ame owumo komme-kica kede bwomgi. Jami magi mom otwero kobo ginnoro iye i yore i yore aman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
